{"id": "t141-002", "text": "Caught up with Deepa after yoga. Her son Arjun has his GCSE maths Friday and has barely slept. She's taking him for pancakes after. Her husband is away in Leeds all week so she's doing it solo.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after yoga"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE maths", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away in Leeds", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t141-012", "text": "Lunch with Aiko and Zhang. Aiko's daughter got into the Royal College of Music, starts in the fall, and Aiko is beside herself. Zhang's son sits his A levels from May 12th through June 20th, so he's in full revision mode and Zhang's barely seeing him. Zhang mentioned his wife Vera wants to redo the kitchen once exams are done. Remind me to send Aiko flowers this week and check how Zhang's lad is doing mid-June.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the Royal College of Music", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the fall", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "beside herself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A levels", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from May 12th through June 20th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p8", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to redo the kitchen", "owner": "p8", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once exams are done", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Aiko flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p9", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how Zhang's lad is doing", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p10", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "lad", "owner": "p2", "same_as": "r2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid-June", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t141-013", "text": "Divya mentioned her nan turns 90 on March 3rd. Big family lunch at the Indian place on the high street. Think about a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 90", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Big family lunch at the Indian place on the high street", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Think about a card", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t141-015", "text": "The christening for Elena's baby is off, the priest is ill. They're rescheduling for sometime in spring. Elena seemed fine about it honestly.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "priest"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t141-016", "text": "Natasha's son Hoang got his uni results back today. 2:1 in engineering! Graduation is July 17th. Natasha said his dad cried on the phone. Don't forget to send a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hoang", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni results", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "2:1 in engineering", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Graduation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 17th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t141-018", "text": "Kemal's nervous about his presentation to the board on Wednesday. His boss is apparently a nightmare. Text him good luck Tuesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "presentation to the board", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nightmare", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t141-024", "text": "Deepa's daughter Divya got her first tooth out yesterday. Tooth fairy left £2 apparently, inflation.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first tooth out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t141-026", "text": "Kofi's wife Amara is expecting again, due in early April! Their son Mandla is thrilled about being a big brother. Kofi's taking paternity leave the whole month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t141-028", "text": "Spoke to Sophie Dubois at the PTA meeting. Her son Nikhil has his 11 plus on September 12th and she's frantic about tutoring. Her husband thinks they're pushing him too hard. She asked if I knew a good maths tutor, should ask Leah if she still does it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie Dubois", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikhil", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "11 plus", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "frantic about tutoring", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Leah if she still does it", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t141-030", "text": "Ciara's son Hoang just started secondary. He's finding the bus really hard and she's worried about the older kids picking on him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hoang", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about the older kids picking on him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t141-032", "text": "Isla mentioned her brother Mustafa just got engaged to Nina! Wedding probably next summer. Isla's maid of honour, already panicking.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t141-035", "text": "Alessia says her dad retires on Friday after 35 years at the post office. Big do at the social club Saturday. Get a card for Alessia to pass on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "35 years at the post office", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Big do at the social club", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get a card for Alessia to pass on", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t141-037", "text": "Sofia's little one, Nina, had her first swimming lesson today. Hated it. Going again Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little one", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nina", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first swimming lesson", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Hated it", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Going again", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t141-041", "text": "Took the car in today. Should be ready Monday. Need to sort a hire car till then.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ready", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a hire car", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
