{"id": "t141-051", "text": "Vera and her husband Mandla are off to Lisbon on the 3rd for a week. Their son Kemal is minding the house and the two cats. Vera says Mandla wants a new camera lens for Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "two cats", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a new camera lens", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
